The [[Stankus' Toothpick]] is a neutral [[Weapon]] normally obtained by combining the [[Hero Sword]] with a [[Garlic]]. Compared to the [[Hero Sword]], [[Stankus' Toothpick]] deals identical damage by default, but costs less stamina. Rather than buffing the weapons around it, [[Stankus' Toothpick]] increases all damage the opponent takes slightly on hit. Since this is a multiplicative and all-encompassing effect rather than the small flat bonus of the [[Hero Sword]], it scales much better into the late game. 

Like all [[Food]]s, [[Stankus' Toothpick]] is faster the more [[Food]]s are around it, although it isn't actually a [[Food]] itself. It can attack up to 100% faster from this, which plays very well with the powerful on hit effect.
